comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T17:05:55.428Z",codex-root,"All-status PM searches for condition evaluation, condition subscription, execute_script, and automation runtime found adjacent completed lineage but no equivalent typed feature."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T17:05:55.428Z",codex-root,"Credentials, raw live payloads, entity IDs, user IDs, context IDs, and location details remain only in 0600 global configuration or transient process memory and never enter Git or PM evidence."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T17:05:55.428Z",codex-root,"Home Assistant 2026.8.0 keeps test_condition, subscribe_condition, and execute_script stable; the local 2026.7.4 instance supports the same contracts, enabling current-plus-backward compatibility proof."
